taic device comprising a transparent substrate, a transparent conductive film, a semiconductor thin film, and a metallic electrode film, the three films being formed on one side of the substrate. The distribution of thickness of the transparent conductive film is within a range of +/-10% of the center thickness. A transparent thin film including at least one layer is formed between the transparent substrate and the transparent conductive film. The colors a* and b* of light reflected from the transparent substrate on which the light is incident vary in the range of +/-5 of the colors a* and b*.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Ce dispositif photovoltaïque comprend un substrat transparent, un film conducteur transparent, un film mince semi-conducteur et un film d'électrode métallique, ces trois films étant formés sur un côté du substrat. La répartition de l'épaisseur du film conducteur transparent représente une variation de +/-10 % par rapport à l'épaisseur centrale. On a formé un film mince transparent comprenant au moins une couche entre le substrat transparent et le film conducteur transparent. Les couleurs a* et b* de la lumière réfléchie à partir du substrat transparent sur lequel la lumière est incidente varient dans une gamme de +/-5 des couleurs a* et b*.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>